,"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-21T22:58:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:18Z","closed_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.beta1.official [46c495ca2]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.1000) - Genuine Intel(R) CPU 0000 @ 2.60GHz (16 threads) - 15.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using `@export_custom` with `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE` for a toggleable group, the associated checkbox in the Inspector does not update visually when its value is changed externally via a `@tool` script.\n\nHere is a video of the issue:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bec928e1-ada8-426c-af72-0333c97e3ef0\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new Node in a scene (e.g., a `Node2D`).\n\n2. Attach a new script to this node.\n\n3. Inside the script, define two `@export_group`.\n\n4. For each group, add an `@export_custom` variable using `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE`.\n\n5. Implement a setter on one of these variables. In the setter, set its own value and also set the other group's variable to the inverse of the current value.\n\nHere's an example script:\n```GDScript\n@tool\nextends Node\n\n@export_group(\"Test A\")\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE, \"\") var enable_a: bool = false\n\n@export_group(\"Test B\")\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE, \"\") var enable_b: bool = false:\n\tset(value):\n\t\tenable_b = value\n\t\tenable_a = !value\n\t\tprint(\"Actual Test A status: %s\" % !value)\n```\n\n6. Save your scene.\n\n7. Reload the scene.\n\n8. With the node selected in the Scene tree, toggle the **Test B** checkbox (the one with the setter) multiple times, the **Test A** will not update unless you deselect the node and select again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20850280/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107826/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107826/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}